<title>JAPAN: Miyuki Keori -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Miyuki Keori -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales			3.81		vs	    3.89</p>
<p> Operating	   44    million	  vs	   57    million</p>
<p> Current	    447    million	  vs	  356    million</p>
<p> Net		  248    million	  vs	  209    million</p>
<p> EPS			  6.84 yen	  vs	    5.78 yen</p>
<p> Shares		   36 million	  vs	  36 million</p>
<p> Interim div		6.25 yen	  vs	    6.25 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Miyuki Keori Co Ltd makes top quality woolen fabrics.</p>
</text>
